<title>ESTONIA: KALEV SHARE INCREASE TO TAKE EFFECT FROM JULY 9.</title>
<headline>KALEV SHARE INCREASE TO TAKE EFFECT FROM JULY 9.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kalev confectionary will increase the number of shares it has in circulation from July 9, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Tueasday.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that Kalev will increase the number of shares in circulation to 342,500 from 92,500.</p>
<p>The increase was approved by the board of the company on March 27 and registered in the companies' register on June 26.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
